### Create user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pramod Singh",
  "email": "pramod@example.com"
}

### List users
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users

### List inventory
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/inventory

### Create approved order
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "productId": 1001,
  "quantity": 1,
  "amount": 2500.00
}

### Create declined order
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "productId": 1001,
  "quantity": 1,
  "amount": 7000.00
}

### Create order with inventory rejection
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "productId": 1002,
  "quantity": 999,
  "amount": 1200.00
}

### List orders
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders

### List payments
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments

### List notifications
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/notifications

### Search indexed orders
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/search/orders
